\", \"E-0146\", \"E-0109\"], \"needs_evidence\": true, \"stale\": false},\n{\"sentence\": \"OFF-6：「2030.tw 應該是推廣聯盟型的導流站，靠 SEO 流量轉成註冊」\", \"problem\": \"另一種可能沒有排除。st=wg2030 和 wg1888 同樣帶 wg，2030.tw 也可能是博弈業者自營的站，而不是第三方聯盟。「靠 SEO 流量」也沒有流量資料支持。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"E-0110\", \"E-0101\", \"E-0156\"], \"needs_evidence\": false, \"stale\": false},\n{\"sentence\": \"行動 1／行動 2 rationale：「可以在內容差異度上勝過它」「它的單頁內容是泛泛的口語評測」\", \"problem\": \"整份報告沒有排名、索引、流量資料，無法知道對手這些頁在「娛樂城」「3A娛樂城」是否有排名或成效。「差異化就能勝過」是沒有被結論支持的假設。單頁內容的評語也只根據 3 頁。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"E-0108\", \"E-0113\", \"E-0115\"], \"needs_evidence\": true, \"stale\": false}\n]}\n```","ttft_ms":60446,"type":"result","duration_ms":91028,"uuid":"3887624a-65ca-4b27-80b9-7a61216a400e","ttft_stream_ms":2351,"time_to_request_ms":422,"first_content_frame_ms":2351,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":9505,"cacheReadInputTokens":539,"cacheCreationInputTokens":121942,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.1657518,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":6011,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":121942,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-07T12:31:42.367Z"}
